Usage of app create:
  -blkio-weight uint
    	block I/O weight (10-1000) (default 500)
  -branch string
    	default branch (default "main")
  -build-arg value
    	build argument KEY=VALUE (repeatable)
  -cpu-millis uint
    	CPU limit in millicores (1000 = 1 core) (default 1000)
  -dockerfile string
    	Dockerfile path relative to the repository root
  -domain string
    	domain to serve the app on; if empty the app is reachable only from the internal network
  -env value
    	environment variable KEY=VALUE (repeatable); sealed at rest, but the running container gets it as a plain variable that docker inspect shows
  -health-path string
    	health check path (default "/")
  -json
    	machine-readable JSON output
  -memory string
    	memory limit (e.g. 512Mi, 2Gi) (default "512Mi")
  -no-www
    	do not also serve and redirect the www partner of the domain
  -port uint
    	port the app listens on inside the container (default 8080)
  -redirect value
    	extra name that redirects (308) to the domain (repeatable)
  -replicas uint
    	number of replicas (default 1)
  -repo string
    	source repository: host/owner/name (e.g. github.com/user/blog)
  -skip-dns-check
    	continue even if the domain's DNS does not point at the server (e.g. Cloudflare proxy)
  -timeout duration
    	overall time limit (default 30s)
  -volume value
    	persistent volume NAME:/mount/point[:ro] (repeatable)
  -s name
    	a server saved with `kadran server add`, instead of the target
